  "translation": "Na ɛbaa sɛ wɔ da a ɛtɔ so nson no, abɔfra no wuiɛ. Na Dawid adefoɔ no ho dwirii wɔn sɛ wɔbɛka akyerɛ no sɛ abɔfra no awu, ɛfiri sɛ wɔkae sɛ, “Monhwɛ, berɛ a abɔfra no da so wɔ hɔ no, yɛkasa kyerɛɛ no na ɔantie yɛn asɛm; na sɛ yɛka akyerɛ no sɛ abɔfra no awu a, ɔbɛyɛ bɔne nei?”",
